## 4. 路由规则库每日自动更新

创建 `/usr/share/daed/dae_rule_update.sh`：

```bash
cat > /usr/share/daed/dae_rule_update.sh <<\x27EOF\x27
#!/bin/bash
set -e

download() {
  local url="$1"
  local dest="$2"
  local tmp="$dest.tmp"
  if wget -q -O "$tmp" "$url"; then
    mv -f "$tmp" "$dest"
    echo "$dest 更新成功"
  else
    echo "$url 下载失败" >&2
  fi
}

download "https://github.com/v2rayA/dist-v2ray-rules-dat/raw/master/geoip.dat" "/usr/share/daed/geoip.dat"
download "https://github.com/v2rayA/dist-v2ray-rules-dat/raw/master/geosite.dat" "/usr/share/daed/geosite.dat"

# 重载 daed 规则
systemctl restart daed
EOF

chmod +x /usr/share/daed/dae_rule_update.sh
```

添加每日定时任务 (`crontab -e`)：

```text
0 4 * * * /usr/share/daed/dae_rule_update.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
```
